# Code and generated docs are LF everywhere, so the --check scripts (readme, plugin, policy and intl evals)
# also pass on a fresh Windows clone (git for Windows checks text out with CRLF by default).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Fixtures are test data in the exact bytes an export has (legacy encodings, CRLF line ends): never converted.
**/fixtures/** -text
*.xlsx binary
*.png binary
